sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant DishTask as DishTask
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+DishTask: retire(reason)
    Note over DishTask: Policies: dishTaskRead, dishTaskWrite, dishTaskExecute
    Note over DishTask: Guards (2)
    DishTask->>DishTask: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    DishTask->>DishTask: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    DishTask->>DishTask: mutate.retiredAt
    DishTask->>DishTask: mutate.retirementReason
    DishTask->>DishTask: mutate.status
    DishTask->>EventBus: emit DishTaskRetired
    DishTask-->>-Client: void